  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ACCORD FOR CONTRIBUTING TOWARDS SUSTAINABLECOALITIONS AT LOCAL GOVERNMENT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The pilot project aims to contribute to sustainable coalitions at local government level in South Africa. Among other things, the project will engage in research and analysis aimed at enhancing the quality of available information about coalitions since 2021. The project will further provide capacity-building in the form of negotiation and mediation trainings targeting political parties and public officials involved in coalition governments in different municipalities in the country.</narrative>
  </description>
